@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# Craft ORODI capability linkage
+
+Status: navigation only. Authority effect: none.
+
+The ORODI-related work in this package is linked to the existing
+[Craft ORODI Product Capabilities](../../../../cyberAlchemy-v2/product/craft/capabilities/orodi/README.md) and
+[related-work register](../../../../cyberAlchemy-v2/product/craft/capabilities/orodi/RELATED-WORK.md).
+
+Coordination: `CA2-PROJECT-CRAFT` / `CA2-GOAL-CRAFT-ORODI-INTEGRATION`.
+The register identifies exact capability references, owners, construction stages,
+related dependencies, runnable work, and operational residue.
+Existing source, compiler, and decision owners retain their responsibilities.
+Frozen records and historical receipts are unchanged.
+
+## Open Questions
+
+See the [shared open questions](../../../../cyberAlchemy-v2/product/craft/capabilities/orodi/RELATED-WORK.md) for definition reconciliation
+and the proposed Alch event/observation integration.
diff --git a/projects/domainspec-v2/impl/cli/EXACT-UINT64.md b/projects/domainspec-v2/impl/cli/EXACT-UINT64.md
